<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
  <meta name="description" content="This page answers all your questions concerning payouts, service, and general points in regards to 159.Cash, 
                                    which is a free and user-friendly tool that allows users to monetize and shorten their url links." />
  <title>Frequently Asked Questions | 159.cash</title>
  <%- include('ledger/assets/css.ejs', { cssFiles: [] }) %>
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/src/images/favicon.png" />
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container-scroller">
        <% if (isAuthenticated) { %>
            <%- include('ledger/sidebar', { currentPage: 'frequentlyAskedQuestions' }) %>
        <% } else { %>
            <%- include('ledger/index/sidebar', { currentPage: 'frequentlyAskedQuestions' }) %>
        <% } %>
        <%- include('ledger/sidebarMini') %>
        <div class="container-fluid page-body-wrapper">
            <div class="main-panel-noheader">
                <div class="content-wrapper">
                    <div class="page-header">
                        <h3 class="page-title"> Frequently Asked Questions </h3>
                        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
                            <ol class="breadcrumb">
                                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/operator">Cash</a></li>
                                <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">F.A.Q.</li>
                            </ol>
                        </nav>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-12 grid-margin stretch-card">
                                    <div class="card border-primary-subtle2">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h4 class="card-title">Why should I choose 159.cash?</h4>
                                            <p>
                                                159.cash should be your first choice when it comes to link shortening if you care about user trust. Our service has no hidden 
                                                tricks to stop your users from reaching their destination. No 60-minute wait times, or multiple redirects!
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-12 grid-margin stretch-card">
                                    <div class="card border-info-subtle2">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h4 class="card-title">How does the 159.cash service work?</h4>
                                            <p>
                                                159.cash is a user-friendly way to make money from internet traffic. Replace existing links with your 159.cash shortened ones, 
                                                and earn money from every click!
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-12 grid-margin stretch-card">
                                    <div class="card border-info-subtle2">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h4 class="card-title">Why should I care about user-friendliness?</h4>
                                            <p>
                                                Redirecting users to a site they can trust, and one that will not hinder their actions greating increases not only 
                                                their satisfaction with the service your provide, but also the chance that they return for more. Repeat customors are 
                                                increadibly valuable and 159.cash helps you achieve this while monetizing your links.
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-12 grid-margin stretch-card">
                                  <div class="card border-success-subtle2">
                                    <div class="card-body">
                                      <h4 class="card-title">Is 159.cash free?</h4>
                                      <p>Yes! The base version of 159.cash is completely free to use, and there are no costs relating to payouts either!</p>
                                    </div>
                                  </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-12 grid-margin stretch-card">
                                    <div class="card border-success-subtle2">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h4 class="card-title">How can I get paid?</h4>
                                            <p>159.cash offers two main payout methods: <br> 1) Bitcoin (for this you need a valid Bitcoin address.) <br> 2) PayPal</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6 d-flex align-items-stretch">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-12 grid-margin stretch-card">
                                    <div class="card border-success-subtle2">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h4 class="card-title">What is the minimum payout threshold?</h4>
                                            <p>
                                                You can request your first payout as soon as you've made $10 or more! The threshold is in place due to the costs assiciated 
                                                with paying users. Requesting payouts on 159.cash is completely free!
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-12 grid-margin stretch-card">
                                    <div class="card border-danger-subtle2">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h4 class="card-title">Are there any specific rules I have to follow?</h4>
                                            <p>
                                                To make the most out of your 159.cash account, it is extremely important to read through our 
                                                <a href="tos" target="_blank">terms of service</a> 
                                                as they outline the rules you should follow to ensure quality traffic and payouts on this platform!
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-12 grid-margin stretch-card">
                                    <div class="card border-success-subtle2">
                                        <div class="card-body">
                                            <h4 class="card-title">Is there a referral program?</h4>
                                            <p>
                                                Yes! 159.cash offers a referral program you can make use of as soon as you create your account. 
                                                Refer new users using your custom link to recieve 12% of their earnings for life!
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-12 grid-margin stretch-card">
                                    <div class="card border-warning-subtle2">
                                      <div class="card-body">
                                          <h4 class="card-title">I have more questions, what can I do?</h4>
                                          <p>
                                              Feel free to create a ticket 
                                              <a href="/ticket">here</a>, 
                                              or reach out to us directly through our official 
                                              <a href="/discord" target="_blank">Discord Server.</a>
                                          </p>
                                      </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <%- include('ledger/infoCards') %>
                </div>
                <%- include('ledger/footer') %>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="/public/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/src/js/main.js"></script>
</body>

</html>